runas /user:backupadmin cmd    #Run a command as another user. Helpful if target user doesn’t have GUI access. **Runas can be used with local or domain accounts as long as the user has the ability to log on to the system.

CrackMapExec

If the target user has the Log on as a batch job access right, we can schedule a task to execute a program of our choice as this user. 
Additionally, if the target user has an active session, we can use PsExec from Sysinternals.
